            adultDose = "Intubation: 0.4 to 0.5 mg/kg IV over 60 seconds. Maintenance: 0.08 to 0.1 mg/kg IV.",
            childDose = "Intubation (≥2y): 0.3 to 0.4 mg/kg IV slow injection.",
            contraindications = "Known severe hypersensitivity to atracurium besylate; severe active asthma / bronchospasm (prefer rocuronium or vecuronium which do not release histamine).",
            modeOfAction = "Competitive antagonist at the nicotinic cholinergic receptors of the striated muscle motor endplate; competes with acetylcholine for the alpha-subunits, preventing endplate depolarization and causing flaccid paralysis.",
            interactions = "Potentiated by Volatile Inhalational Anesthetics, Aminoglycosides, Magnesium Sulfate, Hypokalemia, and Hypothermia (Hofmann elimination slows at low body temperature, prolonging paralysis). Incompatible with alkaline solutions (Thiopental - forms precipitate).",
