            timing = "Local infiltration, nerve block, or IV bolus as clinically indicated.",
            specialInstructions = "Signs of impending LAST toxicity: Lightheadedness, metallic taste in mouth, numbness of tongue and lips (circumoral paresthesia), tinnitus, visual disturbances, muscle twitching, followed by tonic-clonic seizures and cardiovascular collapse. Immediate treatment: Stop local anesthetic, airway/100% O2, Midazolam for seizures, and 20% Intralipid resuscitation.",
