            specialInstructions = "COOPERATIVE SEDATION ('Arousable Sedation'): Unlike propofol or midazolam, dexmedetomidine produces a unique state resembling natural non-REM stage 3 sleep. Patients can be easily awakened to verbal commands, follow instructions, and converse cooperatively, returning to sleep when left unstimulated. ZERO RESPIRATORY DEPRESSION: Does not depress hypoxic or hypercapnic ventilatory drive.",
