            childDose = "1-2 mcg/kg IV slow push over 2 minutes.",
            contraindications = "Known hypersensitivity to fentanyl; severe respiratory depression without mechanical ventilation; acute bronchial asthma; paralytic ileus; concurrent use of MAO inhibitors within 14 days (risk of serotonin syndrome).",
            modeOfAction = "Potent and selective agonist at the mu-opioid receptor in the spinal cord dorsal horn, periaqueductal gray, and thalamus, opening inward-rectifying K+ channels, closing voltage-gated Ca2+ channels, and inhibiting presynaptic release of substance P and glutamate, producing potent analgesia and sedation with 80-100 times the analgesic potency of morphine.",
