            pkPd = "1R-cis 1'R-cis isomer (one of 10 stereoisomers of atracurium; possesses ~3x higher neuromuscular blocking potency than parent mixture). ED95 is 0.05 mg/kg. Onset of intubating conditions: 90-120 seconds. Duration of action is intermediate (55-65 minutes). Clearance occurs via Hofmann elimination (77%) and organ-independent ester hydrolysis. Laudanosine metabolite concentration is approximately one-fifth of that generated by atracurium, eliminating risks of laudanosine-induced CNS seizure excitation. Pharmacokinetics and recovery profiles are completely UNALTERED by end-stage renal disease (ESRD) or severe hepatic cirrhosis.",
